
USAGE
        Users [* | <call>]

DESCRIPTION
        Shows what is connected to the local node, in up to three
        lists:

        AX.25 Level 2 sessions
                the AX.25 links of the node. They carry the users
                connected to it and also its links with the other
                nodes, shown with the callsigns the nodes use
                between themselves.
        ROSE Level 3 sessions
                the ROSE circuits that start or end on this node.
        ROSE Level 3 transits
                the ROSE circuits relayed by this node between two
                of its neighbours.

        With a callsign, only the lines of that callsign are shown.
        With *, the AX.25 sockets waiting for a connection are
        listed too.
